{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To find the value of $k(\\blueD{-5})$, we need to substitute $\\blueD{x}=\\blueD{-5}$ into the function's formula:\n\n$\\begin{align}k(\\blueD{x})\u0026=6\\blueD{x}+100\\\\\\\\\nk(\\blueD{-5})\u0026=6\\cdot(\\blueD{-5})+100\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-30+100\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=70\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion,\n\n$k(-5)=70$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$k(x) = 6x + 100$\n\n$k(-5)=$ [[☃ input-number 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"input-number 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerType":"number","inexact":false,"maxError":0.1,"simplify":"required","size":"normal","value":70},"static":false,"type":"input-number","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
